        "jsCode": "// Generate TwiML response\nconst twimlResponse = `<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<Response>\n  <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna-Neural\">\n    Hello $input.first().json.name, you owe $$input.first().json.amount, for \n    $input.first().json.product. Please press 1 to pay now or 2 to discuss.\n  </Say>\n  <Gather \n    numDigits=\"1\" \n    action=\"/webhook/twilio-choice\" \n    method=\"POST\"\n  />\n</Response>`;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'text/xml' },\n    body: twimlResponse\n  }\n];"
